    "body": "In different languages we use different [quotation marks](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quotation_mark#Summary_table), most prominently „“ and «» or »«.\r\n\r\nI have added these to my pairs mappings as follows:\r\n\r\n````lua\r\n-- Disable and mini.pairs for ' and \" after numbers, like in »45° 15' 30\"«.\r\nlocal pairs_mappings = {\r\n    ['\"'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '\"\"', neigh_pattern = '[^%d\\\\].' },\r\n    [\"'\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"''\", neigh_pattern = '[^%w\\\\].' },\r\n    [\"„\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"„“\" },\r\n    [\"‚\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"‚’\" },\r\n    [\"“\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"“”\" },\r\n    [\"‘\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"‘’\" },\r\n    [\"«\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"«»\" },\r\n    [\"»\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"»«\" }\r\n}\r\n````\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">In different languages we use different <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quotation_mark#Summary_table\" rel=\"nofollow\">quotation marks</a>, most prominently „“ and «» or »«.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have added these to my pairs mappings as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- Disable and mini.pairs for ' and &quot; after numbers, like in »45° 15' 30&quot;«.\nlocal pairs_mappings = {\n    ['&quot;'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '&quot;&quot;', neigh_pattern = '[^%d\\\\].' },\n    [&quot;'&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;''&quot;, neigh_pattern = '[^%w\\\\].' },\n    [&quot;„&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;„“&quot; },\n    [&quot;‚&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;‚’&quot; },\n    [&quot;“&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;“”&quot; },\n    [&quot;‘&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;‘’&quot; },\n    [&quot;«&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;«»&quot; },\n    [&quot;»&quot;] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = &quot;»«&quot; }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Disable and mini.pairs for ' and \" after numbers, like in »45° 15' 30\"«.</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">pairs_mappings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>\"<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>\"\"<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">neigh_pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>[^%d<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>].<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>'<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>''<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">neigh_pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>[^%w<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>].<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>„<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>„“<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>‚<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>‚’<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>“<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>“”<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>‘<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>‘’<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>«<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>«»<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n    [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>»<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">action</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>closeopen<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">pair</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>»«<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>}\n}</pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "In different languages we use different quotation marks, most prominently „“ and «» or »«.\nI have added these to my pairs mappings as follows:\n-- Disable and mini.pairs for ' and \" after numbers, like in »45° 15' 30\"«.\nlocal pairs_mappings = {\n    ['\"'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '\"\"', neigh_pattern = '[^%d\\\\].' },\n    [\"'\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"''\", neigh_pattern = '[^%w\\\\].' },\n    [\"„\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"„“\" },\n    [\"‚\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"‚’\" },\n    [\"“\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"“”\" },\n    [\"‘\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"‘’\" },\n    [\"«\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"«»\" },\n    [\"»\"] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = \"»«\" }\n}",
